5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about us staying friends. Which option keeps the peace?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to know what mornings feel like. What does the air smell like?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to quantify the labor. Who does the setup and the daily upkeep?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see the measurements. I refuse to sign if one gate takes the hit.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the ledger. Who pays for the shelter and the bins?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, if we split costs, does that make us feel like partners?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, I agree. Fairness is key. But I also care about the quiet.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, feelings don't fix a broken schedule. I need the time estimates.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, exactly. I will check the frontages. I want the truth, not a guess.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, labor is money. I will check the expenses. We need the real numbers.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the station block. Maybe they solved this without fighting.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will check the complaint log. I want to know what went wrong before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the ward filing requirements. I need to know the administrative burden.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the measurements. I will also check the station block's minutes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the block ledger. I will also check the ward subsidy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's see what we find. I hope it helps us talk again.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope we find a way to live gently together.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will calculate the hours. I will not let us drown in paperwork.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will make sure no one is left holding the bag. Literally.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from knowing the cost. Let us find the truth.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
