35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I saw the station block's bin house. It smells bad and they fight over sweeping.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I read the complaints. The gate next to the bins is the one that suffers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The filing takes four months. The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen in waste.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,I measured the frontages. One gate is ninety centimetres wide. That is not fair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen in waste. The subsidy covers forty percent.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if one gate is narrow, does that mean we share the burden?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, yes. But I worry the smell will make the narrow gate worse.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, forty percent subsidy is good. But the labor is still on us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, I agree. The narrow gate cannot take the smell. We must move it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the subsidy helps, but the labor is the real cost. We must plan.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I think we should choose the option that lets us talk. Not just the cheapest.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. I want a place where I can walk past without holding my breath.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I will calculate the hours for each option. I will present the data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I will make sure the narrow gate is not the one that suffers. I will check the options.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,Let us look at the options. I will guide us to the one that is fair.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I am ready to vote. I hope we choose the one that keeps us friends.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am ready. I want peace. I want to smile when I walk past.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready. I have the numbers. I will vote for the most efficient.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am ready. I will vote for the one that is fair. I will not let the narrow gate suffer.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I am ready. I will vote for the one that is fair and kind. Let us begin.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
